/*
  ActiveSessionsSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0197 · ActiveSessionsSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  ActiveSessionsSection resolves (table "ActiveSessionsSection") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first groups are the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/settings/components/ActiveSessionsSection.tsx). The remainder back the
  native state envelope (freshness chip, connectivity banner, error retry) and the
  device-label heuristic + accessibility strings.
*/

